                <p>MP Scholarship&nbsp;program is for those students, who are in between&nbsp;9<sup>th&nbsp;</sup>standard to Post Graduation. A significant factor in the percentage is reserved for the girl students. Every year many students get profit through this&nbsp;Mp Scholarship&nbsp;program that is exactly what it is meant for. Eligibility criteria can be different in different years.</p>
